  "instructions": [
    "In a blender or food processor, combine fromage frais, hazelnut butter, sour cream, granulated sugar, and vanilla extract.",
    "Blend the mixture on high speed until it becomes smooth and creamy.",
    "Add ground hazelnuts, lemon zest, and sea salt to the blender.",
    "Blend for another 30 seconds until well combined.",
    "Pour the mixture into a serving dish or individual cups.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 2 hours to allow the flavors to meld together.",
    "Serve chilled and enjoy."
